--- !u!114 &1838110352
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1838110350}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d20f73aabcb4cfbaac49363662be3e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueController
  currentDialogueIndex: 0
  textStartOffset: 0
  dialogues:
  - texts:
    - Ohh-ohng.
    - You have found our sermon. Though it may not look like much...
    - Our order has been relegated to places like these. Dark cracks. Hidden away.
    - The Lady of the Mountain's light shines too radiantly in the open. It would
      burn us out.
    - 'Even now, at the end of the age, it does not falter. In your presence, I feel
      it too. '
    - In, truth we are enemies. Her will is yours. Yours hers. Yet perhaps...
    - ...Perhaps you may take pity on us.
    - Please, runner. Go to the places of old, where we cannot. The plinths. Old
      places of worship.
    - Take this censer. It may yet awaken our Lord before the age finally turns.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - I have given you an old thing. A powerful relic of our faith.
    - There are esoteric forces from beyond that may find its scent... irresistable.
    - We wish to make pilgrimage to the Mountain summit. That censer may allow us
      passage.
    - If you choose to aid our cause, burn the smoke at the Far plinths.
    - Do this, and we may be able to travel onwards...
    - Ohh-ohng.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Does it disturb you? Knowing there are those that turn away from Amadea's light?
    - I would not blame you. In the eyes of many, we are blasphemers.
    - We can only beg for your forgiveness and aid.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - We pray you awaken the plinths. Ohh-ohng, runner.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  DialogueName: Far Archon
  LookAtOverride: {fileID: 1694350055}
  CameraY: 0.7
  canvasDelay: 0
  cameraFollowOffsetLerp: 0
